      "value": "yep been hardly going pass 30 fps was at 90 before the update after went downhill. heck could handle more than 30 people in the presentation room before update now it's like what 20 or somewhere pass that and it starts to lag like crazy. needs fixed badly cause people don't want to just hang out with less that that sometimes. my pc is pretty close to cyans only difference is the processor which is AMD - FX-8350 4GHz 8-Core Processor",
