      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "VR Chat Devs, if you are reading this. All we want is for you to be communicative about these decisions and the work you are doing. You are leaving us out in the dark, a lot of people are unable to play like they were, there are so many bugs running rampant and many of the large scale community events are falling apart due to the fact we can't even include any of our friends. Just say something, anything about what you are planning to do for this stuff. Something your update did is causing a lot of issues for a lot of people.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5af0ee97de552924d5c05d5f",
