      "postID": "5ae696c7906bfd12e600e685",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "As a event planner, of very popular improv nights and of course wedding planning, i could use to do weddings with easily almost 50 people without it really being an issues, it was all dependent on the avatars, and same to improv, but since with this update i have to be a lot more strict on the rosters and cut from about 50 to like lower 30's to even be functional. \n\nMy specs are as followed\ncpu - intel core i7-7700k\ngpu - GTX 1070 8GB\nram - 16Gb\n\nmy pc is well enough for running this game, as well as any game on the market. But when i get to hosting the higher 30's now, im experiencing frame drops like it is no others. \n\nThen not to include that the invite bug is back to top this off with a cherry on top. I have to be praying to hopefully get everyone on the game into a world without it breaking. \n\nPlease just hear our thoughts and make this wonderful game great again for everyone to enjoy - Recon",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
