      "postID": "5ae696c7906bfd12e600e685",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Things to help combat performance issues would be checkboxes in the System Menu that; \n-Disable dynamic bones functions(People with longer hair or skirts destroy performance, mindlessly slamming Dynamic Bones on them)\n-Disable particles from Rendering(Second Life has this, don't see why not here)\n-Disable Lights attached to Avatars\n-A area around you(opposite to personal space) certain distances avatars stop rendering, outside, rather than inside.\nBasically your Avatar Draw Distance. (A slider for meters)\n-Allow blocking of specific user's avatars, to turn them to a grey avatar. Without needing Block Avatars by Default, or ex-communicating them from you.\n\nAny of these will help immensely.\nI don't even want to go to Public rooms anymore, it's getting really hard to deal with this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
